stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> PENDING: POST /bookings
    PENDING --> SEATS_HELD: hold OK
    PENDING --> FAILED: sold out / no quota
    PENDING --> COMPENSATING: inventory unreachable
    SEATS_HELD --> PAYMENT_DONE: payment captured
    SEATS_HELD --> COMPENSATING: declined / bank down / unknown
    PAYMENT_DONE --> CONFIRMED: seats confirmed, PNR issued
    PAYMENT_DONE --> COMPENSATING: confirm failed
    COMPENSATING --> FAILED: refund + release done
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED: cancel (BR7)
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
